1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,752
The ship and the needle both float, but for two completely different reasons.

2
00:00:04,752 --> 00:00:06,236
One is about pressure.

3
00:00:06,236 --> 00:00:09,140
The other is about the surface itself.

4
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:14,830
By the end of this lesson, you will be able to explain both, and a lot more besides.

